  "description": "$sceneMaterial of a renamed texture set (export-plan-compiler.md section 4, R-091, decision 093): the documented API cannot rename a texture set, so the UI operator renames s0 to renamed0 in the Texture Set List after the state steps (settings sheet; read back through TextureSet.name and original_name, and again after the reopen); every stack empty. Probes $textureSet_$sceneMaterial_c with the export root named by the new name and by the original name, and a control. Each probe step names an authored export configuration (the recorder's preset uzp_recorder, PNG 16, no dithering, infinite padding, root paths s0 and s1, changed as the probe says); the recorder lists it with list_project_textures and, when that succeeds, exports it, recording Painter's answer or refusal, the directory content and the files.",
